															"LASTCALLERS - Script to start LastCallers.\n\n"
															"Further Informations about the Logoff-Scripts of\n"
                              "FAME could be found in the main documentation of\n"
	                            "FAME (FAME.guide)."))
	(set #choosebatch (cat			"\nPlease choose for which programs the Installer\n"
                              "should create the start-scripts:"))
